<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">PETER Inni Huuina Chemajia</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETER</para>
  <para style="mt2">Inni Huuina Chemajia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Hiwa 2 Peter Chemajia hi</char> Tirton Peter in imajia eii tia aril, takkha awini kasing-kathei angjet inchu akatuun eii tia ngaidonmu. Hiwahi Peter rathuulla tu ka-ang inkhat in imajia lei-echa inti. Akamajiapa khan hinthoa aril khachu, Jisu ringkhuo khat-um aru ka-ekhet ah meelsuo-inthuulna sakhi kha ama eii ati (2 Peter 1:17-18). Hiwa chemajia hi Peter imajia e-inchu Christa innei suonuk kum 65-69 suungnga ama athi makma Rome makheiya imajia lei-ete. 1 Peter chemajia amajia suona apha thunna Peter innum hiwahi ama inni huuina chemajia eii ati (2 Peter 3:1). Ama'n Christian rakip diang hiwa chemajia hi imajia eii. Peter in hiwa chemajia hi kangamna ngai ringkhuo katha ah omnasik malung masokpi nasik ah khat-um inmani kha chong peya akatuunmak ocha ngai juimak nasik imajia eii (2 Peter 2). Tu ka-ang mi ngai'n Jisu ajuokir nasik apha kasoottak alei kati ngai inloppui maknasik ama'n inmani kha aleimasok. Khawa rathuulla ama'n Pathian chu insuum emak takkha mirakip kha sanringsik manuom tia arilsuok (2 Peter 3:8-9). Hiwajarra eii akatha ringkhuo inkhat-ah niringsik hi (2 Peter 3:14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Peter in ama chemajia kateel ngaidiang iril khat-um apumtak meel imalar. <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ama'n inmani kha akatha ringkhuo-ah ringnasik amin-ngaidon ajarchu Pathian in eini um namintor. <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 1:3-21">1:3-21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ama'n akatuunmak ocha ngai chungnga chong apeii halli ajuohekna ah angme akatuunmak ocha ngaidiang kasuoksik jarra aril. <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Khawasuo Peter in kangamna ngaikha akatha ringkhuo ah ringnasik khat-um Jisu woini huuina ajuo nasik-ah insuuknasik malung masok ah aleiminhek. <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 3:1-17">3:1-17</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Jisu Christa suok le tirton inkhat kachang Simon Peter in,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">eini Pathian khat-um kanasanpa Jisu Christa dikna khan eini ngamna angnga amankatam ngamna ipe ngaidiang:<verse eid="2PE 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Pathian le Nipumi Jisu ningjetna khanna inphut, minriang khat-um akadai kha ningchungnga kasip-ah omrase.<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Koina khat-um Kadangna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>Ama apumtak athana li apoina tum kachang sik-ah anakakoipa kha eini'n nijetna ah inphut, akatuun biaklam ringkhuo ah ringnasik arei kaom Pathian ranak rakip kha einidiang anapejei. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>Khawa jarra hiwa kutchoi ngaihin ajar eya hiwa nuoipilchung manuomna hin mangna sik-ah inphut nangni'n ningsuokthei nasik khat-um Pathian omchan kha tum ningchang theinasik, hinthoa ama'n einidiang chong inkhitna kalokkhet khat-um amankatam kutchoi ngaikha anapejei. <verse eid="2PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Hiwa jarra ningmatorseng tho-inlang nangni ngamna khan akatha kha thundelru halli nangni thana khan singna-theina kha thundelru; <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>nangni singna-theina chungnga pum-insur matorna thundelru; ningpum-insur matorna chungnga deiraatna thundelru; ningdeiraatna chungnga Pathian jetna kha thundelru; <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>Nangni Pathian jetna chungnga Christian inriangna kha thundelru; nangni Christian inriangna chungnga minriang kha thundelru. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Hiwa ngaihi nangni sik-ah arei kaom kul ngaikha eii, nangni'n hiwa ngaihi kheella ningnei inchu, khawa ngaikha in Nipumi Jisu Christa jetna-theina khan nangni ngaikha inringchak khat-um kathozoot namin ete. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Takkha tu e-innum hiwa kul ngaihi innei mak inchu, kalaak-ah kamu matormak mitkacho halli akatheng inmanuwa inphut naminthiangjei tikha inmaniljei.<verse eid="2PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Khawajarra, ulenai ngai, Pathian nakoina le anakadangna kha kheella mincheen nasik thoru; nangni'n kha ningtho inchu, angtikniteii ning-inngamna kha mathaan nutun. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Hinthoa Nipumi le Nakasanpa Jisu Christa hektik kaommak Rengramma luutnasik nangnidiang ranak rakip kha innapesik eii.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Halli nangni'n ningkeiluut jei akatuun khan kacheet-ah ning-om hi ningjetsa ejei-innum, hiwa jarra pha rakip ah kei'n kanaminngaidon sik eii. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Hiwa jarra kei'n karing laiseng nangni ngaidonna malung masokchaksik hi kei sik-ah akatuun eii tia kangaidon. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>Ajarchu Nipumi Jisu Christa in keidiang inthiangnga narilpi angnga, hiwa akamangsik kapum hi innot-ah kamathaansik ejei ti kei'n kajet. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Khawajarra kei'n kathi suonuk hiwa jar hi apha rakip ah nangni sik-ah ningngaidon nasik lam inkhat kei imator sengnga penasik kei'n kathosik eii.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa Lurna Kamu ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Nipumi Jisu Christa in ranak kaneitak ah ajuosik chonghi nangnidiang kinnaminjet pha inbool thurchi ngaikha kinjuiya kinril emak, kinmittak in alok-alianna kha kinleimujei.<verse eid="2PE 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>Pa Pathian in amadiang kayana khat-um lurna apelai, Chungnung khet lurna-ah inphut rasa kha amadiang ajuopha, “Hiwahi kiminriangtak Kasapa kha eii, ama chungnga kamalung atai,” atilai takkhan keini um khawakhan kinleiom! <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Keini'n amale inruoiya ching inthiang chungnga kin omsuom lai, marwaanna inphut hiwa rasa kajuohi kinpumtak in kinjet. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 17:1-5">Matt 17:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-7">Mk 9:2-7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-35">Luk 9:28-35</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Khawajarra Pathian chongkachoi ngai'n inleiril chongkhan kheella eini namin-ngamna eii. Hiwahi Khuowar maklaiseng aziingna munna kawar sariakmei khat-um nangni malung suungnga akawar ziingtiang sorpa ka-ang kha eii, khawajarra nangni'n khawa khan katha-ah malung-minluutsik eii. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Mansakhet-ah, nangni'n hiwahi ngaidonru, Chong-inthiang suungnga Pathian chongkachoi ngai ileiril chong ngaihi tu inkhat innum apumtak in malet matornuni. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Ajarchu Pathian-chongkachoi ngai'n inrilsuok chongpui hi miring lungdouwa inphut hongkasuok sup-eii emak, takkha mi ngai'n Pathian diangnga inphut akajuo chongpui inleiril phakhan Ratha Inthiang inruoipuina nuoiya inmani'n inleiril eii.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Akatuunmak ocha ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Khawalaiya mi ngai karra akadikmak pathian chongkachoi ngaikha inlei-inlar, halli hiwa hile in-ang rip-ah akatuunmak ocha ngai'n nangni karra inlahong inlarsik eii. Inmani'n kakatanpa Karu kha hongzootnunu, halli inmani'n mangnasik ka-eii katuunmak minchuna kha laheichoi inta, inmanitak chungnga jetlei theileiya mangna kha inlaheichoi sik eii. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Kha-ennum, mi katamtak in inmani kathamak taksa manuomna lamtiang inlajuisik eii, halli inmani chuontho jarra akatuun Lam kha mileiilak ngai'n kase-ah inlarilsik eii. <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Hiwa akatuunmak ocha ngai mahamlian jarra inbool thurchi nangnidiang inril ngaikhan nemnasik inlathosik eii. Ajarchu tiallaiya inphut inmani chongkatanpa insuuk suojei, halli inmani Kaminmang sikpa kha intheiya omjei.<verse eid="2PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Ajarchu marwaan tirton manu katho ngaikha Pathian in hooimak, takkha Chongtan nasik Nikhuo min-ngaak ah inmani ngaikha thirruiya inkhit ah aziingna meikhur khan deengluut-ah inmani kha adajei.<verse eid="2PE 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/>Nuoipilchung maruo kha Pathian in hooimak, takkha nuoipilchungnga pathian kajetmak mi ngai chungnga tui minlian; akatuun chongkaril Noah bitkha miring sarile aleisanring. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Inphut 6:1–7:24</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/>Pathian in Sodom li Gomorrah khuopui ngaikha zootmak ah, meiya aleiminmang, halli pathian kajetmak ngai chungnga kasuoksik minkhina hi aleimin eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Inphut 19:24</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/>Ama'n dan kaneimak omchan kathamak katho mi ngai'n inleiminpoong mi katha, Lot kha aleisan. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-16">Inphut 19:1-16</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Mi kathapa kha inmani karra aleiom, halli ziing-nisuo ah ama'n inmani chuon kathamak ngaikha amu khat-um ajet-ah ama malung kapoongnga aleidei. <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Halli khawajarra Pathian kajet mi ngaikha inmani poongna ah inphut Pumi'n angtho thoa sansikme, halli akathamak ngaikha rachaakna nuoiya Chongtan Nikhuo sik-ah angtho thoa dasikme ti ajet, <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>aru ka-ekhet ah inmani taksa manuom kachok khat-um Pathian thomatorna kha kazootmak ngai,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Hiwa akatuunmak ocha ngai'n chimu khat-um inkuor angar, halli chungtiangnga lurna kanei ngaikha kayana neimu; khawa rathuulla, inmani'n inmani kha kase-ah inleiril. <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>Marwaan tirton ngai'n akatuunmak ocha ngai neek-ah kangar khat-um karaat inkheel innum, Pumi maikuungnga inmani chungnga kase-ah rilla noonkuung leipemu. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Surliya thatsik ah injuonei pangringnga karing i-kajetmak ramsa neek-ah inmani ngaihi akatha emu; inmani'n injet lekmak kha kase-ah inril. Inmani kha ramsa ngai angnga inlaminmangsik eii, <verse eid="2PE 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>halli inmani'n poongna inpe angnga inmani um inlaminpoongsik eii. Inmani taksa manuom khachu suunwarra kahur-kakhiang intho kha inmani khopna eii; inmani'n minmangnasik lam ngaikhan inhoi laiseng inrokpui, halli nangni bubakna khan inhong-inchelpha injakna halli maimookna inneisik eii! <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Inmani'n iteii entok manuommu takkha zool-inthai puisik numeisa ngaikha in-entok; inmani manu inthozoot kha angtikniteii kakhop ommak. Inmani'n ratha ah kasuol mi ngaikha surnasik ah inkeiruoi. Inmani malung ngaikha mahamlian nasik ininsuuk jei. Halli Pathian khomaak saamna nuoiya inmani in-omjei!<verse eid="2PE 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>Inmani'n lam katuun kha inmathaanna halli akathamak lamtiang sial kamanuom Beor sapa Balaam injuiya, inmani'n inlam inminchaijei <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 22:4-35">Teelna 22:4-35</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>halli salungdai in ama manu jarra ranjei. Ama salungdai khan miring rasa ah chong ahongrilla Pathian chongkachoi inweet chuontho kha mindajei.<verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Hiwa mi ngaihi kahuul tuiring ngai khat-um thipui seemjuon suumphai ngai ka-ang in-eii; inmani sik-ah Pathian in inthuukkhet kaziingmun kha adapijei. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Inmani'n in-orna khat-um kamo chong inril, halli ringkhuo katuunmak ah kaom mi ngai karra heikasuoklim ngaikha surnasik ah omchan kathamak taksa manuomna ngaikha inleineiman. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>Inmani inpumtak kathamak suok inchanglai khan, inmani diang ninglenuomma omnasik chong ininkhit, ajarchu eini kanamator inkhattak suok kha ni-ejei. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Inmani Nipumi khat-um Nakasanpa Jisu Christa jetna-theina jarra, nuoipilchung kathamak ranak ah inphut aheikasuokjei mi ngaikha woikhat inlet-ah asurli inmani amator inchu, inphutna omchan kathamak kha neek-ah ajuohekna ah hiwa mi ngai omchan hi kase detkha esik eii. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>Inmani diangnga inpe akatuun lam kha injetsuoli chongpeii inthiangnga inphut inkirnooksik neek achu inleijet lekmak khan inmanisik thadoomsik eii.<verse eid="2PE 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/>Inmani diang kasuok khan chongngil ngaikha atuun ti kha amalar: “Ui khan ama maluok kha abak kirnook” halli “Wok tuikabuol suokhan dialbuk ah buol abuolkir.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Chongil 26:11</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Pumi Juonasik Chong-inkhitna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Minriang kaom kasap ngai, tuunna kei'n nangni diangnga kimajia hi inni huuina chemajia kha eii. Chemajia inni ngai suungnga ningngaidonna khan kase katha inthiang tak-ah asuokthei nasik kei'n hiwa ngaihi kinamasok eii. <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>Tiallaiya Pathian chongkachoi inthiang ngai chongril, halli Kanasanpa Pumi makheiya inphut chongpeii nangni tirton ngai'n innapekha ningngaidonsik hi kei'n kamanuom.<verse eid="2PE 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/>Mansakhet-ah, nangni'n hiwa hi jetru, khawa khachu nuk-intong nikhuoni ngaikhan inmani inpumtak taksa-manuom khan inringkhuo kamintor mi lekkhat ngaikha hong-inlar inta, inmani'n nangnikha inna-innuipuisik eii <char style="rq"><ref loc="JUD 1:18">Jud 18</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>halli “Kajuosik eii tia chong-inkhit ama kha, chong-inkhit mak abe? Ama hun omme? Eini nipi-nipu ngaikha inleithijei, takkha angrakip nuoipil inbool makheiya inphut tuunkatung in-ang rip-ah aom!” intisik eii.<verse eid="2PE 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/>Tiallai khan Pathian in chong apeya marwaan li nuoipil hi lei-inbool. Nuoipilchung hi tui in inbool eii halli tui makheiya eii. Khawa akatuun kha inmani'n manil kinte tia inmanil eii, <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 1:6-9">Inphut 1:6-9</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/>halli khawa tuiya inphut tui-minlianna manmasituol maruo kha aleiminmangjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 7:11">Inphut 7:11</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>Takkha tuunna kaom marwaan le nuoipilchung hichu meiya minmang sik-ah in-angrip Pathian chongpe khan ahooiya ida eii. Inmani ngaikha pathian kajetmak mi ngai chongtan nikhuosik khat-um minmang sik-ah ida ngaikha in-eii.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>Takkha minriang kaom kasap ngai, manil maksik inkhat om! Pumi mitmu achu nisuokhat li kum lisingkhat hi inthen ommak; ama diangchu hiwa inni hi in-angrip eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 90:4">Minpkla 90:4</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Mi lekkhat in inngaidon angnga, Pumi chong-inkhitna khan ama'n thosik ah insuummak, khawa rathuulla, ama'n einisik kasoot-ah nadeipi, ajarchu tu-inkhat um kamangsik ama'n manuommak, takkha mirakip in inmanuwa inphut inmalung inhei-inletsik hi ama'n amanuom.<verse eid="2PE 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>Takkha Pumi Nikhuo kha inruup kajuo angnga ajuosik eii. Khawa Nikhuoni khan marwaan ngaihi rasa inringtakle inruoiya lamangsik eii, lairalak-ah kaom rakip um kaangta lamangsik eii, halli nuoipilchung khat-um khanna kaom phur rakip alamangsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Matt 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luk 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:2">1 Thes 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:15">Chonglar 16:15</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Hiwa phur rakip hi hinthoa alamangsik ejarra nangni angkachang mi ngaikha ning-esikme? Nangni ringkhuo kha inthiang khat-um Pathian diang inpesuok ning-esik eii, <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>nangni'n Pathian Nikhuo kha ningngaak halli khawa Nikhuo kha innot-ah juonasik nangni ningmatorseng kha thoru, hiwa Nikhuo ajuotung phakhan marwaan ngaikha akaangwiak-ah inmangsik eii, halli lairalak-ah kaom rakip ngaikha akasa khan aminjungsik eii.<verse eid="2PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/>Takkha akathar marwaan ngai halli akathar nuoipilchung, mi kadik ngai omnasik inn ibooljei Pathian chong-inkhitna kha eini'n ningaak eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Isa 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Chonglar 21:1</ref></char><verse eid="2PE 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Khawajarra, kiminriang kasap ngai, khawa Nikhuo kha ningngaak lai, Pathian mitmuwa kamasialmak khat-um inthiang ningchang nasik halli amale inruoiya kahoi-kadaiya omtheinasik nangni'n ningmatorseng kha thoru. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Minriang kaom nisuopui Paul ama'n Pathian ipe singna kha neimanna nangni diangnga imajia angnga, nangni sanring theinasik aphakacha kanapeii Nipumi deiraatna kha enru <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>Ama chemajia rakip ah hiwa chong jarhi ama'n amajia. Ama chemajia suungnga intak lekkhat kha om, khawa ngaikha akajet tungmak khat-um malung kangirmak mi ngai'n aleiilak Pathian-chong mun ngaikha katuunmak tiang inril angnga akatuunmak tiang inrilsik eii. Khawajarra intheinuo-ah mangnasik inhei-inchoi.<verse eid="2PE 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Takkha kiminriang kasap ngai, nangnichu, hiwahi ningjet suojei, dan kaneimak mi ngai masialna khan innaruoimak nasik halli nangirna mun kacheet-ah inphut napurmak nasik inringchakru. <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Takkha Nipumi le Nakasanpa Jisu Christa jetna-theina riangwai tiang inchatleiya insoon chakru. Tuun khat-um kumsoot sik-ah ama lurna erase! Amen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
